  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central Asia Techno-Thermal Retrofitting for Public and Private Residential Buildings</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the successful efforts of the Mongolia team in supporting the government to improve energy efficiency in buildings, this project aims to enable an increased inflow of investment into the region and scale up retrofitting efforts to reduce building heat loss, save energy, lower GHG emissions and air pollutants, and improve the comfort and well-being of building residents in Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, and Turkmenistan.</narrative>
  </description>
