    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project drives sustainable development by transforming energy-inefficient buildings into climate-smart assets, reducing emissions, lowering energy costs, and enhancing well-being while fostering green growth across the region.</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emissions Reduction: Monitoring reports on greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions pre- and post-retrofitting, verified by third-party assessments.Energy Cost Savings: Utility bills and energy audits demonstrating reductions in energy consumption and costs for retrofitted buildings.Well-being Enhancement: Surveys and feedback from building occupants on improved indoor air quality, comfort, and living conditions.</narrative>
